        "ex-the-bird-theorem-properly-extends-the-bull-case"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "thm-cichons-diagram-inequalities",
      "statement": "In ZFC the ten named ideal and eventual-domination cardinals satisfy the stated elementary ideal, null-to-meagre, cross-ideal and bounding inequalities, together with all their transitive consequences.",
